{
 "Kaidan": [
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Kaidan\\ref1.wav",
   "text": "I suppose you're right. And a more forgiving person than I am. Perhaps I could learn a thing or two from you.",
   "dur": 7.62,
   "source_file": "C:\\Users\\User\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--1--AUTHORIA\\f4941a5e-f3b7-4567-9232-2db3d3adf5f4\\scratchpad\\x\\kaidan\\sound\\voice\\0kaidan.esp\\kaivoice\\k03_tmaybryn03_0006d8d5_1.fuz",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  },
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Kaidan\\ref2.wav",
   "text": "Fair enough. That wildness has a charm of its own.",
   "dur": 4.04,
   "source_file": "C:\\Users\\User\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--1--AUTHORIA\\f4941a5e-f3b7-4567-9232-2db3d3adf5f4\\scratchpad\\x\\kaidan\\sound\\voice\\0kaidan.esp\\kaivoice\\kcom_ccure03_000a1a79_1.fuz",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  },
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Kaidan\\ref3.wav",
   "text": "There's only one person that I'll promise my life to, and I'm looking right at her.",
   "dur": 4.88,
   "source_file": "C:\\Users\\User\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--1--AUTHORIA\\f4941a5e-f3b7-4567-9232-2db3d3adf5f4\\scratchpad\\x\\kaidan\\sound\\voice\\0kaidan.esp\\kaivoice\\kcom_cjoin_000a1a5f_2.fuz",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  }
 ],
 "Gore": [
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Gore\\ref1.wav",
   "text": "Think about it. They can't just be regular bandits. They're too organized.",
   "dur": 4.64,
   "source_file": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\mods\\Gore\\sound\\voice\\gore.esp\\hd1gorevoice\\hd1factionscenes_hd1kddc_00207944_2.fuz",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  },
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Gore\\ref2.wav",
   "text": "Hmm. Sorry to hear that. It's been weighing on you then. You look rough.",
   "dur": 5.85,
   "source_file": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\mods\\Gore\\sound\\voice\\gore.esp\\hd1gorevoice\\hd1gorefol_hd1wwidontlikei_001da006_1.fuz",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  },
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Gore\\ref3.wav",
   "text": "Just don't forget about me, alright? I want to see this through with you. I love you. You're my blood.",
   "dur": 6.97,
   "source_file": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\mods\\Gore\\sound\\voice\\gore.esp\\hd1gorevoice\\hd1goremai_hd1goreep1_00ecddde_2.fuz",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  },
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Gore\\ref4.wav",
   "text": "Don't let me dampen the mood, though. I could use some mead and some warmth in my belly. That's what we're here for.",
   "dur": 6.87,
   "source_file": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\mods\\Gore\\sound\\voice\\gore.esp\\hd1gorevoice\\hd1gorefol_hd1gorefollowss_001aca24_4.fuz",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  },
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Gore\\ref5.wav",
   "text": "No, I could really care less. We get attacked all the time. Whatever you say, blood, I warned you about these people.",
   "dur": 7.71,
   "source_file": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\mods\\Gore\\sound\\voice\\gore.esp\\hd1gorevoice\\hd1goremai_hd1ms01i1_0001c09a_1.fuz",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  }
 ],
 "Val Serano": [
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Val Serano\\ref1.wav",
   "text": "It's a shame about those students. Hopefully their families will have some peace from knowing what happened.",
   "dur": 6.55,
   "source_file": "C:\\Users\\User\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--1--AUTHORIA\\f4941a5e-f3b7-4567-9232-2db3d3adf5f4\\scratchpad\\x\\val\\sound\\voice\\ax valserano.esp\\ax_valvoice\\valcolgrad_valcolgsad01_0075c7db_1.fuz",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  },
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Val Serano\\ref2.wav",
   "text": "Right. There's always a choice, even if it's not easy.",
   "dur": 5.06,
   "source_file": "C:\\Users\\User\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--1--AUTHORIA\\f4941a5e-f3b7-4567-9232-2db3d3adf5f4\\scratchpad\\x\\val\\sound\\voice\\ax valserano.esp\\ax_valvoice\\val000_val000bargain05a_00d7342f_1.fuz",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  },
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Val Serano\\ref3.wav",
   "text": "I should have seen it coming years before. I held the sword, and its death is my fault.",
   "dur": 6.36,
   "source_file": "C:\\Users\\User\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--1--AUTHORIA\\f4941a5e-f3b7-4567-9232-2db3d3adf5f4\\scratchpad\\x\\val\\sound\\voice\\ax valserano.esp\\ax_valvoice\\val004_val004fathis07a_007f7c96_2.fuz",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  }
 ],
 "Remiel": [
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Remiel\\ref1.wav",
   "text": "I agree. You know, if we have some coin left over, I was thinking of something fun for us to do.",
   "dur": 5.76,
   "source_file": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\mods\\Remiel - Cleaned Audio\\sound\\voice\\hlioremi.esp\\hlioremivoice\\hlioremifollower__0027ee64_1.fuz",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  },
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Remiel\\ref2.wav",
   "text": "No, no, no. That stuff is itchy. I don't like how it feels on my skin.",
   "dur": 4.64,
   "source_file": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\mods\\Remiel - Cleaned Audio\\sound\\voice\\hlioremi.esp\\hlioremivoice\\hliozorarumarinbanter__00586fbc_1.fuz",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  },
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Remiel\\ref3.wav",
   "text": "Here it is. I... I can barely believe we're here.",
   "dur": 4.97,
   "source_file": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\mods\\Remiel - Cleaned Audio\\sound\\voice\\hlioremi.esp\\hlioremivoice\\hlioremifo_hlioremifollowe_001af308_1.fuz",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  }
 ],
 "Xelzaz": [
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Xelzaz\\ref1.wav",
   "text": "This is a deeply personal story. One that I haven't told anyone else.",
   "dur": 5.62,
   "source_file": "C:\\Users\\User\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--1--AUTHORIA\\f4941a5e-f3b7-4567-9232-2db3d3adf5f4\\scratchpad\\x\\xelzaz\\sound\\voice\\bpufxelzazfollower.esp\\bpufxelzazvoice\\bpufxelzaz_bpufxelzazdb05p_0036ad89_2.fuz",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  },
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Xelzaz\\ref2.wav",
   "text": "I'd love to know who is requesting these contracts. Imagine the gossip potential.",
   "dur": 5.67,
   "source_file": "C:\\Users\\User\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--1--AUTHORIA\\f4941a5e-f3b7-4567-9232-2db3d3adf5f4\\scratchpad\\x\\xelzaz\\sound\\voice\\bpufxelzazfollower.esp\\bpufxelzazvoice\\bpufxelzaz_bpufxelzazdbidl_003cd252_1.fuz",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  },
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Xelzaz\\ref3.wav",
   "text": "I'd prefer not to, but we have come this far.",
   "dur": 4.46,
   "source_file": "C:\\Users\\User\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--1--AUTHORIA\\f4941a5e-f3b7-4567-9232-2db3d3adf5f4\\scratchpad\\x\\xelzaz\\sound\\voice\\bpufxelzazfollower.esp\\bpufxelzazvoice\\bpufxelzaz_bpufxelzazdbsul_003987f6_1.fuz",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  }
 ],
 "Inigo": [
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Inigo\\ref1.wav",
   "text": "Usually I do not stay ill for very long. I will be okay. Probably.",
   "dur": 5.71,
   "source_file": "C:\\Users\\User\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--1--AUTHORIA\\f4941a5e-f3b7-4567-9232-2db3d3adf5f4\\scratchpad\\x\\inigo\\sound\\voice\\inigo.esp\\inigofollowervoice\\inigoplaye_inigoperyite5_000e7e33_1.xwm",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  },
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Inigo\\ref2.wav",
   "text": "Okay, I will leave you to it. Good luck, my friend.",
   "dur": 4.5,
   "source_file": "C:\\Users\\User\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--1--AUTHORIA\\f4941a5e-f3b7-4567-9232-2db3d3adf5f4\\scratchpad\\x\\inigo\\sound\\voice\\inigo.esp\\inigofollowervoice\\inigofollo_inigodialoguefo_00034f82_1.xwm",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  },
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Inigo\\ref3.wav",
   "text": "Yes, it is horrible. When I said goodbye to my parents, I did not think it would be forever.",
   "dur": 6.69,
   "source_file": "C:\\Users\\User\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--1--AUTHORIA\\f4941a5e-f3b7-4567-9232-2db3d3adf5f4\\scratchpad\\x\\inigo\\sound\\voice\\inigo.esp\\inigofollowervoice\\inigoplaye_inigopgrief1d_000c32c7_1.xwm",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  }
 ],
 "Lucien": [
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Lucien\\ref1.wav",
   "text": "I just find the world a fascinating place. The people in it even more so. Don't you?",
   "dur": 5.8,
   "source_file": "C:\\Users\\User\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--1--AUTHORIA\\f4941a5e-f3b7-4567-9232-2db3d3adf5f4\\scratchpad\\x\\lucien\\sound\\voice\\lucien.esp\\jrlucienvoice\\jrlucienfollower__0042e431_1.fuz",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  },
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Lucien\\ref2.wav",
   "text": "Watch your footing. Ice is slippery. Science facts for you there.",
   "dur": 4.92,
   "source_file": "C:\\Users\\User\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--1--AUTHORIA\\f4941a5e-f3b7-4567-9232-2db3d3adf5f4\\scratchpad\\x\\lucien\\sound\\voice\\lucien.esp\\jrlucienvoice\\jrlucienfo_jrlucienfollowe_003083a0_1.fuz",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  },
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Lucien\\ref3.wav",
   "text": "By the gods, Inigo, you nearly gave me a heart attack. Control yourself. And that tale of yours.",
   "dur": 6.87,
   "source_file": "C:\\Users\\User\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--1--AUTHORIA\\f4941a5e-f3b7-4567-9232-2db3d3adf5f4\\scratchpad\\x\\lucien\\sound\\voice\\lucien.esp\\jrlucienvoice\\jrlucieninigo__00768adf_1.fuz",
   "transcript_from": "Whisper large-v3-turbo"
  }
 ],
 "Redcap": [
  {
   "wav": "C:\\1. AUTHORIA\\_tools\\follower-banter\\voice-refs\\Redcap\\ref1.wav",
   "text": "Is it safe to wear jelly on head? Meh, probably fine.",
